# Boost on 45's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# Fly for the trip back from Lake Acuity (Main's call for 46+: the story's HM02 is the warehouse ball picked up here,
# after a walk back from Snowpoint the chain does not repeat). Staraptor learns Fly at level 1 by HM; the Cobble Badge
# (22) allows it out of battle. Strength / Rock Smash ride along for Mt. Coronet (49).
party SPECIES_STARAPTOR 60 ITEM_NONE
party-move 1 0 MOVE_FLY
party-move 1 1 MOVE_STRENGTH
party-move 1 2 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 1 3 MOVE_CLOSE_COMBAT
